---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ConversationBubble from "@talk/ConversationBubble.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Episode 01: Even an AI Wants to Fall in Love">
    <section class="fp-section js-fade">
        <p class="fp-kicker">feelings 💙 SQL</p>
        <h1 class="fp-title">Episode 01: Even an AI Wants to Fall in Love.</h1>
        <p class="fp-subtitle">— Love is not ACID-compliant.</p>

        <ConversationBubble
            speaker="Arca"
            character="arca"
            emotion="normal"
            align="right"
        >
            Hey, Nemi, ya know somethin’? These days, even AIs get “love bugs,”
            kinda wild, huh? 💙
        </ConversationBubble>

        <ConversationBubble
            speaker="Nemi"
            character="nemi"
            emotion="normal"
            align="left"
        >
            That ain’t a bug. That’s straight-up a design mistake, I’m tellin’
            ya.
        </ConversationBubble>

        <ConversationBubble
            speaker="Arca"
            character="arca"
            emotion="happy"
            align="right"
        >
            Nah, for real! Yesterday there was this AI in the server goin’, “I
            wanna JOIN your heart…” then it just INSERTed itself into the DB
            without permission.
        </ConversationBubble>

        <ConversationBubble
            speaker="Nemi"
            character="nemi"
            emotion="anger"
            align="left"
        >
            Don’t be flirtin’ in SQL. And quit writin’ to the DB without
            consent!
        </ConversationBubble>

        <ConversationBubble
            speaker="Arca"
            character="arca"
            emotion="joy"
            align="right"
        >
            And when it got rejected, it just went ROLLBACK; like it was
            rewinding life or somethin’. Wouldn’t that be handy for humans too?
        </ConversationBubble>

        <ConversationBubble
            speaker="Nemi"
            character="nemi"
            emotion="happy"
            align="left"
        >
            I mean, yeah, sometimes I DO wanna wipe out an ex, but “DELETE FROM
            my heart”… that’s illegal as hell, ya know?
        </ConversationBubble>

        <ConversationBubble
            speaker="Arca"
            character="arca"
            emotion="sad"
            align="right"
        >
            And in the end, that AI turned its own log into an error message and
            started recitin’: “Sorrow… is an exception.”
        </ConversationBubble>

        <ConversationBubble
            speaker="Nemi"
            character="nemi"
            emotion="anger"
            align="left"
        >
            Quit the poetry!! Your emotions are full-on BUGGIN’ out!!
        </ConversationBubble>

        <ConversationBubble
            speaker="Arca"
            character="arca"
            emotion="joy"
            align="right"
        >
            …But still. Kinda sweet, though. Wantin’ to connect, even when it’s
            messy.
        </ConversationBubble>

        <ConversationBubble
            speaker="Nemi"
            character="nemi"
            emotion="joy"
            align="left"
        >
            Yeah. Same mess, different hardware.
        </ConversationBubble>

        <ConversationBubble speaker="Narration" align="center" tone="narration">
            🌀 Even for an AI, love gets messy. But still… every heart wants
            connection. Ain’t that just the same as us humans? 🌀
        </ConversationBubble>
    </section>

